irst</span></div></section></div><div id="performance-view" hidden="" class="mt-3 space-y-3"></div><div id="deposit-view"><div class="mt-3 grid grid-cols-1 gap-3 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1.25fr)_minmax(0,0.75fr)]"><section class="min-w-0 rounded-[28px] border border-white/12 bg-char p-5 sm:p-8"><h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-cream">Add to existing position</h2><p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-5 text-smoke">Choose an asset from your wallet. We swap it into the pool tokens as needed, then add liquidity to the existing LP position selected above in one transaction. Your position keeps its current price range.</p><span id="asset-label" class="mt-6 block text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-smoke">Asset to add from wallet</span><button type="button" aria-labelledby="asset-label" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" disabled="" class="mt-2 flex min-h-20 w-full items-center gap-3 rounded-2xl border border-white/12 bg-char px-4 py-3 text-left transition-colors hover:border-white/20 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-white/30 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50"><span class="min-w-0 flex-1 truncate text-sm text-smoke">No wallet assets found</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-smoke" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><dialog aria-labelledby="asset-dialog-title" class="fixed inset-x-0 bottom-0 top-auto m-0 max-h-[85dvh] w-full max-w-[100vw] overflow-hidden rounded-t-[20px] border border-white/12 bg-canvas p-0 text-cream shadow-2xl shadow-black/60 backdrop:bg-black/80 backdrop:backdrop-blur-sm sm:inset-0 sm:m-auto sm:max-h-[78vh] sm:max-w-xl sm:rounded-[28px]"><div class="flex max-h-[85dvh] flex-col sm:max-h-[78vh]"><div class="border-b border-white/12 px-5 pb-4 pt-5 sm:px-6"><div class="flex ite