t-cream outline-none placeholder:text-smoke/50" value=""><span class="text-sm font-semibold text-cream/80">Input asset</span></div><div class="mt-3 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-smoke"><span>Available for input balance: —</span><button type="button" class="font-semibold text-cream/80 hover:text-cream disabled:opacity-40" disabled="">MAX</button></div><details class="mt-5 text-xs text-smoke"><summary class="cursor-pointer font-semibold">Advanced settings · Price tolerance 1.0%</summary><div class="mt-3 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.06] px-4 py-3"><div><label for="tolerance" class="text-sm font-medium text-cream/80">Add-liquidity price tolerance</label><p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-5 text-smoke">Room for the pool price to move before execution; 0–5%, by 0.1%. The unused reserve stays in your wallet as pool assets.</p></div><div class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1"><input id="tolerance" inputmode="decimal" min="0" max="5" step="0.1" class="w-16 rounded-lg border border-white/20 bg-white/10 px-2 py-1.5 text-right text-base sm:text-sm font-semibold text-cream outline-none focus:border-white/40" type="number" value="1.0"><span class="text-sm text-cream/80">%</span></div></div></details><p class="mt-5 text-xs leading-5 text-smoke">Preview updates after entering an amount. Add liquidity runs the final checks before wallet confirmation.</p><div class="mt-6 hidden sm:block"><button class="inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-lemon px-5 py-4 text-sm font-semibold text-ink transition-colors hover:bg-[#fff27f] disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-40" disabled="" aria-busy="false"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-down h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14"></path><path d="m19 12-7 7-