></section></div><div id="performance-view" hidden="" class="mt-3 space-y-3"></div><div id="deposit-view"><div class="mt-3 grid grid-cols-1 gap-3 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1.25fr)_minmax(0,0.75fr)]"><section class="min-w-0 rounded-[28px] border border-white/12 bg-char p-5 sm:p-8"><h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-cream">Add to existing position</h2><p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-5 text-smoke">Choose an asset from your wallet. We swap it into the pool tokens as needed, then add liquidity to the existing LP position selected above in one transaction. Your position keeps its current price range.</p><span id="asset-label" class="mt-6 block text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-smoke">Asset to add from wallet</span><button type="button" aria-labelledby="asset-label" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" disabled="" class="mt-2 flex min-h-20 w-full items-center gap-3 rounded-2xl border border-white/12 bg-char px-4 py-3 text-left transition-colors hover:border-white/20 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-white/30 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50"><span class="min-w-0 flex-1 truncate text-sm text-smoke">No wallet assets found</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-smoke" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><dialog aria-labelledby="asset-dialog-title" class="fixed inset-x-0 bottom-0 top-auto m-0 max-h-[85dvh] w-full max-w-[100vw] overflow-hidden rounded-t-[20px] border border-white/12 bg-canvas p-0 text-cream shadow-2xl shadow-black/60 backdrop:bg-black/80 backdrop:backdrop-blur-sm sm:inset-0 sm:m-auto sm:max-h-[78vh] sm:max-w-xl sm:rounded-[28px]"><div class="flex max-h-[85dvh] flex-col sm:max-h-[78vh]"><div class="border-b border-white/12 px-5 pb-4 pt-5 sm:px-6"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4"><div><h2 id="asset-dialog-title" class="text-lg font-semibold text-cream">Select input asset</h2><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-smoke">Only listing assets discovered in this wallet; verify name and mint.</p></div><button type="button" aria-label="Close asset selection" class="rounded-full p-2 text-smoke hover:bg-white/[0.06] hover:text-cream"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-x h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 6 6 18"></path><path d="m6 6 12 12"></path></svg></button></div><div class="mt-5 flex items-center gap-3 rounded-2xl border border-white/12 bg-char px-3.5 py-2.5 focus-within:border-white/20"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-search h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-smoke" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m21 21-4.34-4.34"></path><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle></svg><input aria-label="Search assets" placeholder="Search name、symbol or mint" class="min-w-0 flex-1 bg-transparent text-base sm:text-sm text-cream outline-none placeholder:text-smoke/70" type="search" value=""></div></div><div class="min-h-0 overflow-y-auto overscroll-contain px-2 pb-[calc(1.25rem+env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px))] pt-3 sm:px-3 sm:pb-5"><p class="px-3 py-12 text-center text-sm text-smoke">No wallet assets matching search criteria</p></div></div></dialog><label for="amount" class="mt-7 block text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-smoke">Input limit</label><div class="mt-2 flex items-center gap-2 rounded-2xl border border-white/20 bg-white/[0.06] px-4 py-3 focus-within:border-white/40"><input id="amount" disabled="" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="0.00" class="min-w-0 flex-1 bg-transparent text-3xl font-semibold text-cream outline-none placeholder:text-smoke/50" value=""><span class="text-sm font-semibold text-cream/80">Input asset</span></div><div class="mt-3 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-smoke"><span>Available for input balance: —</span><button type="button" class="font-semibold text-cream/80 hover:text-cream disabled:opacity-40" disabled="">MAX</button></div><details class="mt-5 text-xs text-smoke"><summary class="cursor-pointer font-semibold">Advanced settings · Price tolerance 1.0%</summary><div class="mt-3 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.06] px-4 py-3"><div><label for="tolerance" class="text-sm font-medium text-cream/80">Add-liquidity price tolerance</label><p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-5 text-smoke">Room for the pool price to move before execution; 0–5%, by 0.1%. The unused reserve stays in your wallet as pool assets.</p></div><div class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1"><input id="tolerance" inputmode="decimal" min="0" max="5" step="0.1" class="w-16 rounded-lg border border-white/20 bg-white/10 px-2 py-1.5 text-right text-base sm:text-sm font-semibold text-cream outline-none focus:border-white/40" type="number" value="1.0"><span class="text-sm text-cream/80">%</span></div></div></details><p class="mt-5 text-xs leading-5 text-smoke">Preview updates after entering an amount. Add liquidity runs the final checks before wallet confirmation.</p><div class="mt-6 hidden sm:block"><button class="inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-lemon px-5 py-4 text-sm font-semibold text-ink transition-colors hover:bg-[#fff27f] disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-40" disabled="" aria-busy="false"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-down h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14"></path><path d="m19 12-7 7-7-7"></path></svg>Add liquidity</button></div><div role="status" class="mt-3 min-h-5 text-xs text-smoke">Wallet has no available for input assets</div></section><aside class="min-w-0 space-y-3"><section class="rounded-[28px] border border-white/12 bg-char p-5 sm:p-7"><h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-cream">Add liquidity preview</h2><p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-5 text-smoke">Auto-calculate after selecting position and asset, entering amount</p></section></aside></div></div></main></div><footer class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-5 px-2 py-6 font-data text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-smoke"><a class="transition-colors hover:text-cream" href="/docs">Docs</a><a class="transition-colors hover:text-cream" href="/faq">FAQ</a><a class="transition-colors hover:text-cream" href="/docs/risks">Risks</a><a class="transition-colors hover:text-cream" href="/terms">Terms</a></footer></div><dialog aria-labelledby="_r_id_" class="fixed left-1/2 top-1/2 m-0 max-h-[calc(100dvh-2rem)] w-[calc(100%-2rem)] max-w-lg -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 overflow-y-auto rounded-[28px] border border-white/15 bg-char p-6 text-cream shadow-2xl backdrop:bg-black/70 sm:p-8"><h2 id="_r_id_" class="text-xl font-semibold">Detailed information and asset risks</h2><div class="mt-5 space-y-3 break-words text-sm leading-6 text-smoke [overflow-wrap:anywhere]"><p>Different tokens may have issuer, transfer restrictions, or routing liquidity risks. APR does not represent this position's realizable returns; no trading fees collected for this range while outside.</p><p><a class="text-lemon underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-[#fff27f]" href="/docs/risks">Read the Risks docs</a> before adding liquidity.</p></div><button type="button" class="mt-6 w-full rounded-full bg-lemon px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-ink transition-colors hover:bg-[#fff27f] focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-lemon">Understand</button></dialog><div data-testid="mobile-action-bar" class="fixed inset-x-0 bottom-0 z-10 border-t border-white/12 bg-canvas/95 p-4 pb-[calc(1rem+env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px))] backdrop-blur sm:hidden"><button class="inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-lemon px-5 py-4 text-sm font-semibold text-ink transition-colors hover:bg-[#fff27f] disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-40" disabled="" aria-busy="false"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-down h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14"></path><path d="m19 12-7 7-7-7"></path></svg>Add liquidity</button></div></div>"`;
